  "operating_rules": [
    "Each engine is a governed logical capability, independently buildable and contract-testable; physical repository extraction is a controlled migration decision.",
    "Every engine MUST have isolated state ownership and permissions, authoritative write API, explicit errors, and production fail-closed behavior.",
    "No direct cross-engine database reads/writes; use versioned API or event connector with scoped authority.",
    "Shared runtime libraries are limited to cross-cutting primitives, not domain business logic.",
    "No mock/synthetic payment, booking, stock or fiscal results in live environments.",
    "Existing marketplace checkout and FISCAL isolation must not be broken during extraction.",
    "GitHub Projects boards track work; repositories host code. One does not replace the other."
